{"id":"CVE-2023-54419","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"VulnCheck","published":"2026-11-18T15:35:01.446Z","updated":"2026-11-18T16:29:17.872Z","title":"nginxWebUI 3.0.0 < 3.5.8 Authentication Bypass RCE via runCmd","description":"nginxWebUI 3.0.0 before 3.5.8 contains an authentication bypass vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to reach the /AdminPage/conf/runCmd endpoint by using a case-variant path that evades the case-sensitive /adminPage/ login filter. Attackers can pass OS commands through the cmd parameter, which are executed via /bin/sh with insufficient filtering of & and $() characters, achieving remote code execution. Exploitation evidence was first observed by the Shadowserver Foundation on 2023-10-14.","cwe":["CWE-178 Improper Handling of Case Sensitivity"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"4.0","score":9.3,"sev":"CRITICAL","vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N"},{"src":"cna","v":"3.1","score":9.8,"sev":"CRITICAL","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"poc","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"total"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"cym1102","product":"nginxWebUI","defaultStatus":"unaffected","versions":["affected 3.0.0 <3.5.8 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://www.ctfiot.com/124166.html","tags":["technical-description","exploit"],"name":"CTF Blog"},{"url":"https://github.com/qingchenhh/qc_poc/blob/main/Goby/nginxWebUI_runCmd_rce.go","tags":["exploit"],"name":"Goby PoC"},{"url":"https://github.com/cym1102/nginxWebUI/commit/6b8c9bceb0d210632a35cd324db6b43caf442a23","tags":["patch","issue-tracking"],"name":"Fix Commit"},{"url":"https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/vulnerabilities/other/nginxwebui-runcmd-rce.yaml","tags":["technical-description"],"name":"Nuclei Template"},{"url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/nginxwebui-3.0.0-before-3.5.8-authentication-bypass-rce-via-runcmd","tags":["third-party-advisory"],"name":"VulnCheck Advisory: nginxWebUI 3.0.0 before 3.5.8 Authentication Bypass RCE via runCmd"},{"url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/nginxwebui-3.0.0-3.5.8-authentication-bypass-rce-via-runcmd","tags":["third-party-advisory"],"name":"VulnCheck Advisory: nginxWebUI 3.0.0 < 3.5.8 Authentication Bypass RCE via runCmd"}],"credits":["The Shadowserver Foundation"],"vendors":["nginx"]}
